{"title": "Sentient Amulet (Rare)", "pageid": 3597, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Rare)", "categories": ["Amulets", "Rare items", "Sources of Thunder damage", "Monk set", "Thunder set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)\">Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)</a>        </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png/300px-Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f7/Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sentient Amulet (Rare) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png/300px-Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Sentient_Amulet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Sentient Amulet\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Sentient Amulet</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> that allows the wearer to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/38px-Shatter_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/50px-Shatter_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shatter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> (with a drawback) and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/25px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/38px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/50px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/25px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\">Ki Restoration (Lesser)</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Sun-graced warmth</a> radiates from both the pendant and its chain. Somehow, even a brief glance of it brings a smile to your face.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 125 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  125  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_UND_MonkAmulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_MonkAmulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_MonkAmulet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">086ae8fd-c44e-43a7-b8be-777b551a06d6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:086ae8fd-c44e-43a7-b8be-777b551a06d6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:086ae8fd-c44e-43a7-b8be-777b551a06d6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_MonkAmulet_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_MonkAmulet_Amulet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_MonkAmulet_Amulet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/40px-Shatter_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/60px-Shatter_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/80px-Shatter_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shatter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/40px-Shatter_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 2 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Talk to the Sentient Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp/40px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp/60px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp/80px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Talk to the Sentient Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp/40px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Talk to the Sentient Amulet\">Talk to the Sentient Amulet</a> </dt>\n<dd>Speak with the consciousness lingering inside the Sentient Amulet. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/40px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/60px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/80px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ki Restoration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/40px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\">Ki Restoration</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Using the spiritual energy in the amulet, you restore <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/30px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/40px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Points</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Wearing this amulet applies the condition:\n</p>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Spirits_(Condition)\" title=\"High Spirits (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"High Spirits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/High_Spirits_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/High_Spirits_(Condition)\" title=\"High Spirits (Condition)\">High Spirits</a></dt>\n<dd>The amulet's spirit lingers, making everything seem a little more vibrant. Must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/38px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/50px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">DC</a> 10/15/20, see notes) when using the amulet's power, or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hysterical_(Condition)\" title=\"Hysterical (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hysterical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hysterical_(Condition)\" title=\"Hysterical (Condition)\">Hysterical</a> (equivalent in effect to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter\" title=\"Tasha's Hideous Laughter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp/25px-Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp/38px-Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp/50px-Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tasha's Hideous Laughter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp/25px-Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tasha%27s_Hideous_Laughter\" title=\"Tasha's Hideous Laughter\">Tasha's Hideous Laughter</a> with a duration of 1 turn).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\">Abandoned Refuge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-624&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;224</span>: In a locked <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Chest\" title=\"Adamantine Chest\">Adamantine Chest</a> on the island with the broken structure near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\">Lava Elemental</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Picking up the amulet triggers a conversation in which the amulet tries to get party member to surrender to a fit of laughter. This is a hint at the curse the amulet bears. Once the conversation is over, the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Cursed_Monk\" title=\"Help the Cursed Monk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help the Cursed Monk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Cursed_Monk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Help the Cursed Monk\">Help the Cursed Monk</a> is received.</li>\n<li>The amulet is voiced by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1372889\">John O'Mahony</a>.</li>\n<li>Wisdom Saving Throws are only required when using this amulet to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/38px-Shatter_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/50px-Shatter_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shatter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter</a>. Using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/25px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/38px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/50px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp/25px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Ki_Restoration_Lesser_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Lesser)\">Ki Restoration (Lesser)</a> ability does not prompt a Wisdom save.</li>\n<li>The default Wisdom Saving Throw for Hysterical is a DC 10. However, after succeeding the Saving Throw at least three times and upon either equipping the amulet or leaving camp (whichever happens first), a special cutscene plays where passing a DC 10 Wisdom Saving Throw to resist the curse is necessary. If failed, the Hysterical DC is increased to 15. If the Wisdom Saving Throw for Hysterical is succeeded a further three times (and then equipping the amulet or leaving camp again), a similar cutscene plays whereby failing a DC 15 Wisdom Saving Throw increases the Hysterical DC to 20. After this, no additional cutscenes will occur.</li>\n<li>Depending on the outcome of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Spirit_of_the_Amulet\" title=\"Help the Spirit of the Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help the Spirit of the Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Spirit_of_the_Amulet\" title=\"Help the Spirit of the Amulet\">Help the Spirit of the Amulet</a> quest in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>, the party may receive a version of this amulet that is visually identical but missing all of its special properties (<code>UID: UNI_WYR_MonkAmulet_NoGhost / UUID: 14a6da9a-6689-4c70-96a1-d03319ba3278</code>). Alternatively, the player may receive the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)\">Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)</a>.</li>\n<li>While the player character carries the Sentient Amulet, the Cursed Monk occasionally makes comments at various locations and after specific interactions.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195815\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no